# Google Maps Platform API Key (REQUIRED — never commit real keys!)
#
# Quickstart with a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key (prototyping only):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate and copy your demo key, then create a local `.env` file:
#      cp .env.example .env
# 5. Replace the placeholder below with your key in `.env`.
#
# Required Google Cloud APIs for production keys:
# - Maps JavaScript API
# - Places API (New)
# - Geocoding API
# Always restrict production keys by HTTP referrer and enabled APIs:
# https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
